---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import '../../styles/lab.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="People — Worldeology Lab" description="People building the Worldeology Lab research program in Cognitive AI." headerTone="paper" active="people" image="/og.png">
  <main id="main" class="lab-site lab-page">
    <header class="lab-page-hero"><p class="lab-index">Worldeology Lab / People</p><h1>People who<br />follow the trajectory.</h1><p>The lab is being built as a small, research-first group spanning social cognition, metacognitive systems, model mechanisms, and interactive world modeling.</p></header>
    <section class="lab-page-section" aria-labelledby="people-core"><header><p class="lab-index">01 / Core</p><h2 id="people-core">Founder and research group.</h2></header>
      <div class="people-grid">
        <article class="person-card founder"><img src="/assets/images/xuanming-zhang.webp" width="886" height="886" alt="Xuanming Zhang" /><div><span>Founder</span><h3>Xuanming Zhang</h3><p>Research scientist working on Cognitive AI, Theory of Mind, reflective reasoning, inference-time mechanisms, and long-horizon interactive worlds.</p><p>Current affiliations and collaborations include Qwen, Stanford NLP, and academic partners working across human-centered AI and foundation-model evaluation.</p><nav><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zP5k9lsAAAAJ">Scholar ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/XMZhangAI">GitHub ↗</a></nav></div></article>
        <article class="person-card forming"><div><span>Founding group</span><h3>Members will be listed as the lab forms.</h3><p>We will not convert paper co-authorship into lab membership by assumption. Named member profiles will appear here only after roles are confirmed.</p></div><a href="mailto:xuanmingdi.zxm@alibaba-inc.com?subject=Worldeology%20Lab%20collaboration">Discuss research collaboration ↗</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="lab-page-section" aria-labelledby="collab-title"><header><p class="lab-index">02 / Collaboration</p><h2 id="collab-title">The field is larger than one institution.</h2></header><div class="lab-prose"><p>Worldeology Lab is designed to collaborate across universities, frontier-model teams, social-science groups, and creative-technology communities. The common requirement is not organizational affiliation; it is a serious interest in how cognition becomes action and how action changes the world.</p></div></section>
    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
